# Snippet bodies are prompt payload sent verbatim to the model. CRLF survives
# parsing (block/frontmatter regexes are \r?\n-tolerant) but the carriage
# returns reach the model and make whitespace-only diffs indistinguishable
# from real drift against the development copy. Pin everything to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
